    "preamble": "Ravindra Singh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 21 February, 2024 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Rajendra Kumar-Iv On The 21 st Of February, 2024 Misc. Petition No. 7434 of 2023 Between:- 1. Ravindra Singh S/O Ayodhya Prasad, Aged About 41 Years, D- 1/87 A, Vinay Nagar, Bhodapur Gwalior Madhya Pradesh (Manager- Puralite Dairy And Agri Farms Private Ltd.) (Madhya Pradesh) 2. Vijay Verma S/O Shri Radheshyam Verma, Aged About 42 Years, R/O Near Balaji Vidya Mandir School, R.K. Puri, Gwalior (Director Nominee M/S Puralite Dairy And Agri Farms Private Ltd) (Madhya Pradesh) 3 . Manager Ravindra Singh M/S Puralite Dairy And Agri Farms Private Ltd R/O Sumerpada, Dhaneli Road, Morar, Gwalior (Madhya Pradesh) .. (By Shri Pawan Nagori - Advocate) And 1. The State Of Madhya Pradesh Principal Secretary, Department Of Food Civil Supplies And Consumer Protection, Vallabh Bhawan, Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh) 2. Shri Govind Narayan Sargaya, Food Safety Officer The State Of Madhya Pradesh, Food Safety Departmnet R/O New Colectorate City Center, Gwalior (Madhya Pradesh) ..... (By Shri Shiraz Qureshi - Government Advocate) This petition coming on for admission this day, th e co Signature Not Verified Signed by: Abhishek Chaturvedi Ravindra Singh vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 21 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/116489768/ 1 Signing time: 21-02-2024 05:25:51 Pm 2 following: Order Heard on I.A. No.1521/2024, which has been moved by the petitioners for conversion of this miscellaneous petition into miscellaneous appeal.",
